    <pubDate>Wed, 16 Aug 2023 08:32:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>对话EthSign创始人闫欣：The Network State、Web3大规模应用、协议与应用层发展和EthSign【Rex Talk】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a> Intro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">2:04</a> 个人背景与行内经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="813">13:33</a> Web3行业现状看法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1358">22:38</a> “胖协议与胖应用”话题讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a> 以太坊的行业地位</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2051">34:11</a> 期待的行业发展方向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2453">40:53</a> 智能合约的潜力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2653">44:13</a> “Web3版的Web2应用”与Web3走向大规模应用看法讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3110">51:50</a> 怎样才是一个“好的Web3应用”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3283">54:43</a> EthSign在做的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3443">57:23</a> EthSign的不同产品板块</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3887">1:04:47</a> EthSign的多链计划&amp;布局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3948">1:05:48</a> EthSign团队提出的EIP-6066</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4094">1:08:14</a> EthSign对VC投融资环境变革的助力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4533">1:15:33</a> EthSign值得期待的下一步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4762">1:19:22</a> EthSign的2C端</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4913">1:21:53</a> The Network State概述</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5201">1:26:41</a> Network State的形式与意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5485">1:31:25</